;; CITATIONS: verified 2026-09-01 against retrieved sources (see refs/README.md
;; for files, URLs and checksums). Equation numbers below were read from the
;; retrieved PDFs; :eq on a row is the specific equation the row reduces from.
;; Parr-Pezzulo-Friston 2022 could not be retrieved and is cited for notation only.
