             :verified {:table2 "p. 777: 2 ln B₁₀ in 6–10 (B₁₀ 20–150) = 'strong'; > 10 = 'very strong'. So ln BF ≥ 3 is the lower edge of 'strong'. Verified by eye (scanned PDF)."}
             :note "Supports the magnitude 3 only; the direction is the WM sign convention stated under :friston2018bmr."
             :retrieved "refs/kass1995.pdf"}}

