   :note "F_π ENTERED THIS ROW 2026-09-01 (RUN9 / stage S4), which is why :imports gained :F-pi and the formal line its third term: the registry previously said the WM scores policies by G only, and that is no longer true when FUTON_WM_FPI_POSTERIOR=1. It reaches ONE site, this posterior. The decision map records a second ordering beside it -- :habit-adjusted-ranking and its :counterfactual winner, at policy.clj:360-362 -- and that one is still ln E - G/tau with no F_π, so a reader must not take the two as the same object. Computed and recorded; the live path then selects deterministically (see :action), so what F_π moves here is the recorded posterior and not the enacted action -- measured, RUN9: 133 of 145 ranks move and the argmax does not."}
