   :formal "a = a + sum_tau o_tau (x) s_tau  (Dirichlet concentrations accumulated from observed outcome/state pairs)" :eq "dacosta2020 eq. 21 (A-learning; B/D learning A.1 eqs. 27-33 per C453)"
