   :note "The theory edges R2->R17 and R1->R17 (o and μ into the Dirichlet accumulation, eq. 21) have no realisation found. An earlier version of this row claimed realisation 'by way of TRACE'; that was wrong (registry author's error, corrected on claude-20's check). The BMR the WM runs is over a capability x mission Dirichlet model built from substrate graph structure, not over the tick model's o and μ."}
  {:id :model-reduction :defines :Delta-F :node :R17 :class :theory-defined :ref :friston2018bmr
